{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tavernhold</strong> is a single-player mix of daylight inn-management and nighttime tower defense. Build up a profitable roadside tavern, gather the resources you need, and hold the line when undead waves march on your gate.\u00a0Guard the inn\u2014if it falls, your fight is over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Assign Workers &amp; Gather, Build &amp; Serve Your Customers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire your workers to assign them\u00a0where they\u2019re needed most: gathering food and timber, constructing new rooms and tables, repairing defenses, or manning the walls when night falls.<br><br>Feed travelers and rent out rooms to earn gold, then reinvest it into more workers, faster resource nodes, and stronger defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863310/extras/a33860a50b91fa9d1b7b96c2a84471f2.poster.avif?t=1757968816\" width=800 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863310/extras/a33860a50b91fa9d1b7b96c2a84471f2.webm?t=1757968816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863310/extras/a33860a50b91fa9d1b7b96c2a84471f2.mp4?t=1757968816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Spend wood to add tables, guest rooms, spike traps, stronger gates, or new resource outposts. Decide what matters most before the night arrives!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend the Gate</strong>At night, place your workers onto the walls to shoot the enemies and take direct control of a giant ballista. Slow the undead horde with spike traps, pierce clustered enemies with well-placed bolts, and keep your enemies away from breaching the gate\u2014too many slip through and it\u2019s game over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863310/extras/f5ed7d1dc906174b6fb4959aabecce0f.poster.avif?t=1757968816\" width=800 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863310/extras/f5ed7d1dc906174b6fb4959aabecce0f.webm?t=1757968816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863310/extras/f5ed7d1dc906174b6fb4959aabecce0f.mp4?t=1757968816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the daily rhythm of gather-build-serve, then withstand each night\u2019s siege to keep your tavern from falling!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3863310?t=1757968816","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3863310?t=1757968816","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863310/956ac630e35e96322d6744235e9b1c7ef6fdfdc4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757968816","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863310/956ac630e35e96322d6744235e9b1c7ef6fdfdc4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757968816","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tavernhold</strong> is a single-player mix of daylight inn-management and nighttime tower defense. Build up a profitable roadside tavern, gather the resources you need, and hold the line when undead waves march on your gate.\u00a0Guard the inn\u2014if it falls, your fight is over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Assign Workers &amp; Gather, Build &amp; Serve Your Customers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire your workers to assign them\u00a0where they\u2019re needed most: gathering food and timber, constructing new rooms and tables, repairing defenses, or manning the walls when night falls.<br><br>Feed travelers and rent out rooms to earn gold, then reinvest it into more workers, faster resource nodes, and stronger defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863310/extras/a33860a50b91fa9d1b7b96c2a84471f2.poster.avif?t=1757968816\" width=800 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863310/extras/a33860a50b91fa9d1b7b96c2a84471f2.webm?t=1757968816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863310/extras/a33860a50b91fa9d1b7b96c2a84471f2.mp4?t=1757968816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Spend wood to add tables, guest rooms, spike traps, stronger gates, or new resource outposts. Decide what matters most before the night arrives!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend the Gate</strong>At night, place your workers onto the walls to shoot the enemies and take direct control of a giant ballista. Slow the undead horde with spike traps, pierce clustered enemies with well-placed bolts, and keep your enemies away from breaching the gate\u2014too many slip through and it\u2019s game over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863310/extras/f5ed7d1dc906174b6fb4959aabecce0f.poster.avif?t=1757968816\" width=800 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863310/extras/f5ed7d1dc906174b6fb4959aabecce0f.webm?t=17